,"sprite":"/art/2026-11-02/neutron.webp"},{"id":"bloom","name":"Biofoundry Bloom","tier":"regular","bodyPlan":"plant","role":"summoner","routines":["spawn","strike"],"source":"/biotechnology","blurb":"Grown in a corrupted biofoundry. It reproduces whenever you stop looking at it.","sprite":"/art/2026-11-02/bloom.webp"},{"id":"tornado","name":"Test Tornado","tier":"regular","bodyPlan":"flier","role":"debuffer","routines":["corrupt","strike"],"source":"/buildings-and-construction","blurb":"Part of the research on how buildings withstand tornadoes. It got out of the test and kept the building's roof.","sprite":"/art/2026-11-02/tornado.webp"},{"id":"labcoat","name":"Empty Lab Coat","tier":"regular","bodyPlan":"humanoid","role":"mirror","routines":["echo"],"source":"/careers","blurb":"Still reporting for work. There's nobody inside it, and it copies whatever it saw you do last.","sprite":"/art/2026-11-02/labcoat.webp"},{"id":"deadweight","name":"Deadweight Engine","tier":"elite","bodyPlan":"construct","role":"shielder","routines":["brace","strike+"],"source":"/laboratories/tools-instruments","blurb":"A force machine stacked with twenty equal weights. The swarm taught it to walk.","sprite":"/art/2026-11-02/deadweight.webp"},{"id":"salamander","name":"Burn Test Salamander","tier":"elite","bodyPlan":"beast","role":"charger","routines":["charge","strike"],"source":"/fire","blurb":"It crawled out of the fire research lab, and it's been in the eye of the fire ever since.","sprite":"/art/2026-11-02/salamander.webp"},{"id":"wafer","name":"Wafer Spider","tier":"elite","bodyPlan":"construct","role":"summoner","routines":["spawn","sweep","strike"],"source":"/chips","blurb":"A semiconductor wafer with legs, walking off a production line that no longer exists.","sprite":"/art/2026-11-02/wafer.webp"},{"id":"second","name":"The Last Accurate Second","tier":"boss","bodyPlan":"colossus","role":"bruiser","routines":["jam","sweep","strike+"],"source":"/pml/time-and-frequency-division/time-services","blurb":"The swarm's heart in this site: a colossal clock that has decided what time it is. Every system still trusts it.","sprite":"/art/2026-11-02/second.webp"},{"id":"caliper","name":"Calibrated Caliper","tier":"ally","bodyPlan":"object","role":"shielder","routines":["cover","breach","strike"],"source":"/calibrations","blurb":"Freed from the calibration lab. It measures the gap in any armor, and it doesn't round off.","sprite":"/art/2026-11-02/caliper.webp"},{"id":"beacon","name":"Rescue Beacon","tier":"ally","bodyPlan":"flier","role":"healer","routines":["patch","triage","strike"],"source":"/public-safety","blurb":"Built to locate survivors in a collapsed building. It's still looking, and now it's found you.","sprite":"/art/2026-11-02/beacon.webp"}],"events":[{"id":"storefront","source":"/calibrations","title":"The calibration storefront","text":"The new calibration storefront is still taking orders, but the price list has been overwritten with teal digits.","options":[{"label":"Empty the till","effect":{"type":"gold","amount":45},"result":"Nobody stops you. Nobody is here."},{"label":"Book a calibration","effect":{"type":"heal","amount":0.25},"result":"The bench still works. The crew feels true again."}]},{"id":"radio","source":"/pml/time-and-frequency-division/time-services","title":"An old radio station","text":"A time-signal transmitter hums in a back room, still broadcasting. The swarm's been listening to it, too.","options":[{"label":"Jam the signal and learn how","effect":{"type":"routine","id":"jam"},"result":"You learn Jam."},{"label":"Strip it for parts","effect":{"type":"gold","amount":30},"result":"You pocket the good copper."}]},{"id":"spectral","source":"/chemistry","title":"The mass spectral library","text":"Shelves of chemical fingerprints, half eaten. One entry describes exactly how to flush the swarm out of a system.","options":[{"label":"Copy the entry","effect":{"type":"routine","id":"purge"},"result":"You learn Purge."},{"label":"Sell the shelf's index","effect":{"type":"gold","amount":35},"result":"Someone, somewhere, still pays for these."}]},{"id":"laugh","source":"/performance-excellence","title":"A blog post about laughing","text":"A performance excellence blog insists that a little enjoyment is always important. The swarm has only eaten the second half of the jokes.","options":[{"label":"Finish the jokes yourselves","effect":{"type":"heal","amount":0.2},"result":"They're terrible. The crew feels better anyway."},{"label":"Keep moving","effect":{"type":"nothing"},"result":"Nobody laughs. You make good time."}]},{"id":"burnroom","source":"/fire","title":"The burn room","text":"Fire testing has deep roots here. The burn room door is hot, and there's a lockbox on the far side.","options":[{"label":"Run through for the lockbox","effect":{"type":"gold","amount":70},"result":"You come out richer, smelling of soot."},{"label":"Vent the room first","effect":{"type":"heal","amount":0.1},"result":"It takes a while. The crew sits and breathes."}]},{"id":"reference","source":"/srm","title":"Standard reference materials","text":"Rack after rack of sealed samples, each one the exact thing it says it is. In here, that's rare.","options":[{"label":"Compare yourselves to the samples","effect":{"type":"routine","id":"patch+"},"result":"You learn Early Patch."},{"label":"Take a crate to trade","effect":{"type":"gold","amount":40},"result":"It's heavier than it looks."}]},{"id":"smallbiz","source":"/tpo","title":"A small business grant","text":"An abandoned partnerships office still has an award letter on the desk, made out to whoever's holding it.","options":[{"label":"Cash it","effect":{"type":"gold","amount":50},"result":"The swarm doesn't check signatures."},{"label":"Read the fine print","effect":{"type":"routine","id":"last_stand"},"result":"Buried in clause nine: Last Stand."}]},{"id":"aftermath","source":"/resilience","title":"A post-disaster survey","text":"A resilience team's field kit sits where they left it, with notes on how communities recover after the worst has passed.","options":[{"label":"Use the kit","effect":{"type":"heal","amount":0.3},"result":"Good notes. Better bandages."},{"label":"Learn their method","effect":{"type":"routine","id":"cover"},"result":"You learn Cover."}]}],"shop":["patch","brace","sweep","finish","breach","cover","purge","jam","charge","triage"]}]}